<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">

    <p>Hi Team,</p>

    <p>A new RFQ / New Product Request has been assigned to the CPT team.</p>

     Key Details:
    <ul>
      <li><strong>RFQ Number:</strong> {!Case.CaseNumber}</li>
      <li><strong>Opportunity:</strong> {!Case.Opportunity__c}</li>
      <li><strong>Customer:</strong> {!Case.Account}</li>
      <li><strong>Requested Product:</strong> {!Case.Description}</li>
      <li><strong>Submitted By:</strong> {!Case.CreatedBy}</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Please review the RFQ in Salesforce and claim ownership for starting the investigation process.</p>

    <p>
      <a href="{!Case.Link}">{!Case.CaseNumber}</a>
    </p>

    <p>Thank you,<br>
    Carlton Packaging CRM</p>

  </body>
</html>